      "type": "text",
      "value": "A recent survey of the hourly wages of spinning workers showed that mean hourly wages was TK 2020 with a standard deviation of TK 320. Assume the distribution of hourly wages follows the normal distribution. If we select a worker at random, what is the probability that the worker earns-"
    },
