      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) Between TK 2020 and TK 2400 per hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii)About 95% of the wages."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii). About 68% of the wages."
